ped by Brian is one of intense emotional distress, characterized by visible crying and expressions of shock and heartbreak. She engages in a direct, confrontational interaction with Brian on stage, while the other woman, Dominique, is present as a silent observer to Alexis's breakdown.\n"], 'condensed_response': '**Condensed Scene Summary (character‑by‑character, keyed to frame timestamps)**  \n\n| Frame (timestamp) | Action / Emotion | Characters Involved |\n|-------------------|------------------|---------------------|\n| **090\u202f–\u202f094\u202f (frames\u202f0920‑0940)** | Alexis (green dress) first hears Brian’s announcement. Her eyes widen, mouth opens in a gasp – pure shock. | Alexis |\n| **095\u202f–\u202f099\u202f (frames\u202f0950‑0990)** | She steps onto the stage, moves close to Brian and points at him, beginning a heated verbal confrontation. | Alexis, Brian |\n| **100\u202f–\u202f103\u202f (frames\u202f1000‑1030)** | Host\u202fJerry\u202fSpringer and two security guards appear behind Brian, bracing for escalation. | Jerry\u202fSpringer, Security |\n| **104\u202f–\u202f106\u202f (frames\u202f1040‑1060)** | Dominique (pink top) enters the frame, subtly positioned as Brian’s new partner; she watches silently. | Dominique, Brian |\n| **107\u202f–\u202f109\u202f (frames\u202f1070‑1090)** | Alexis’ face starts to crumple; a single tear forms. | Alexis |\n| **110\u202f–\u202f112\u202f (frames\u202f1100‑1120)** | She covers her mouth with a hand – a classic gesture of trying to stifle a sob. | Alexis |\n| **113\u202f–\u202f115\u202f (frames\u202f1130‑1150)** | Tears spill freely; Alexis is seen sobbing openly, mouth open in a raw, anguished cry. Dominique remains in the background, expression serious but non‑confrontational. | Alexis, Dominique |\n| **Overall** | The sequence tracks Alexis’ emotional arc: **initial disbelief → confrontational attempt → rapid collapse into tears**. Brian remains largely off‑camera after the dump, while Dominique’s passive pre